WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.575
The accessibility panel opens from the header.

00:00:01.575 --> 00:00:05.568
Larger text, underlined links and a readable font.

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:07.299
Grayscale, and every setting stays on for every Skribly site.

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:08.960
One button puts everything back.
